  attribute the system cannot resolve when it inflates the small icon outside the app's themed
  context. Android 16 rejects such a notification with CannotPostForegroundServiceNotificationException
  ("Bad notification for startForeground"). A status-bar icon must be white-on-transparent with no
  theme reference (the system applies its own tint), so this variant drops the ?attr tint entirely.
